      "image": "https://www.stockdaddy.in/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Femt-stockdaddy-prod.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com%2FPUBLIC%2FASSETS%2F1697439392584difference-between-cash-flow-statements-and-fund-flow-statements.jpg&w=1920&q=75",
